  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "OpenTelemetry for instrumenting services: the OpenTelemetry Specification 1.61.0 (API and SDK for traces, metrics and logs, resources, propagation, environment variables and declarative configuration), Semantic Conventions 1.44.0 (resource, HTTP, database, messaging, RPC, errors and exceptions, and the OTEL_SEMCONV_STABILITY_OPT_IN migration from the pre-stable HTTP conventions of v1.20.0 and earlier), and OTLP 1.11.1 (gRPC and HTTP transports, JSON encoding, partial success, retry and size limits). It pins specification v1.61.0, semantic-conventions v1.44.0 and opentelemetry-proto v1.11.1, and tracks OTLP profiles as a Development preview. References are split into versions, signals and SDK, configuration, semantic conventions and OTLP.",
